  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(0.01 × 0.01 × 0.01 +0.003 × 0.003 × 0.003)/(0.05 × 0.05 - 0.015 × 0.05+0.015 × 0.015)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na³ + b³ = (a + b)(a² - ab + b²)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(0.01 × 0.01 × 0.01 +0.003 × 0.003 × 0.003)/(0.05 × 0.05 - 0.015 × 0.05+0.015 × 0.015)\n\n⇒ (0.013 + 0.0033)/(5 × 0.01 × 5 × 0.01 - 5 × 0.01 × 5 × 0.003 + 5 × 0.003 × 5 × 0.003)\n\n⇒ (0.013 + 0.0033)/(25 × 0.01 × 0.01 - 25 × 0.01 × 0.003 + 25 × 0.003 × 0.003)\n\n⇒ (0.01³ + 0.003³)/25(0.012 - 0.01 × 0.003 + 0.0032)\n\n⇒ (0.01 + 0.003)/25\n\n⇒ 13/25 × 10- 3\n\n**∴ The value is 13/25 × 10⁻³**\n\n33:T977,\n<",
